(M·N·k) — dramatically faster than full ","type":"text"},{"code":"dgesdd_","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" O(M·N²) when k ≪ min(M, N).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Algorithm (Halko 2011)","type":"heading","anchor":"Algorithm-Halko-2011"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Draw random Gaussian matrix Ω ∈ ℝ^{N×(k+p)}  (p=10 oversampling).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Compute range sketch Y = A·Ω  via BLAS dgemm.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orthonormalize Y via thin QR (dgeqrf + dorgqr).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Project B = Qᵀ·A  (small k×N matrix).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Compute small exact SVD of B with dgesdd_.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Back-project left singular vectors: U = Q·Ũ.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Reference","type":"heading","anchor":"Reference"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Halko N., Martinsson P.G., Tropp J.A. (2011). Finding Structure with Randomness:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Probabilistic Algorithms for Constructing Approximate Matrix Decompositions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SIAM Review 53(2):217–288.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/RandomizedSVD/Result":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Result","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"RandomizedSVD.Result","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD\/Result","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Result of a Randomized SVD decomposition."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Result","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/